# Nothing here is ever line-ending converted.
#
# tests/run.sh proves that every .bf is byte for byte what bfexpand makes of
# its skeleton, and bfstyle's size budget rests on that equality holding -- it
# is what licenses the budget to count a skeleton instead of the generated
# brainfuck. A CRLF checkout breaks all thirty of those comparisons at once and
# leaves bflint passing, because \r is not a brainfuck command byte. Thirty
# confusing failures and a clean lint is a worse morning than a merge conflict,
# so autocrlf is refused here rather than left to whatever the clone was
# configured with.
* -text
